  + SelfWorkLifecycleRequest and SelfWorkLifecycleCheckpoint already validate exact plan lineage attempt identities predecessor-bound transitions dependency release and complete review states
  + WorkStepClass already contains ProposeSucceedingSop and the current six-step fixture places it after inspection analysis update verification and publication proposals
