& [GapAudit]
  + no existing type preserves bounded raw succeeding-SOP source bytes with exact causal work lineage
  + no existing verifier proves that the selected succeeding-SOP step is the exact ready attempt with all direct dependencies complete
  + no existing receipt separates machine verification from independent semantic review satisfaction signature and activation
  + no existing strict machine form binds author evidence unresolved frontier and source digest into one proposal

& [ReuseDecision]
  + reuse existing public boot plan lifecycle validators digests SemanticId ContentDigest serde and SHA-256 substrate
  + add one isolated safe cantor_core module and one stdin/stdout CLI with no dependency delta
  + do not reuse the CPPE authorship lane as capability or semantic truth because its pipeline subjects differ
  + do not import SWA-04B B1 candidate selection process or root authority

& [AuthorityConclusion]
  + SJS formation may proceed for a pure supplied-data proposal and replay verifier
  + implementation may proceed only after exact canonical requirements phase lock readiness review and satisfaction signature
  + any live self-authored model output physical source write semantic signature activation or end-to-end SWA-07 integration remains later work
